{"id":"a3a661ee56e37de5","group":"89","path":"89/89-prop-reflection-hierarchy.md","title":"Reflection Hierarchy Proposition","display":"prop-reflection-hierarchy — Reflection Hierarchy Proposition","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-prop-reflection-hierarchy","aliases":["89-prop-reflection-hierarchy"],"display":"prop-reflection-hierarchy — Reflection Hierarchy Proposition","depends_on":["[[89-df-reflection-formula]]"],"revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-prop-reflection-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-prop-reflection-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-reflection-hierarchy — Reflection Hierarchy Proposition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0d2469f2990d6f49\" href=\"?note=0d2469f2990d6f49\" title=\"89-df-reflection-formula\">89-df-reflection-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_T\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_T\\)</span> 为递归可枚举算术理论；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_T:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_T)\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_T:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_T)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0(T)=\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_T(n)\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0(T)=\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_T(n)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0d2469f2990d6f49\" href=\"?note=0d2469f2990d6f49\" title=\"89-df-reflection-formula\">89-df-reflection-formula</a> 的同一族，所有反射实例使用同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> 和同一编码。</li>\n<li>假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ (\\Sigma_k^0(T)\\subseteq\\Sigma_{k+1}^0(T))\">\\(\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ (\\Sigma_k^0(T)\\subseteq\\Sigma_{k+1}^0(T))\\)</span>；该前提量化整个族，不仅量化结论外部某个固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma_n^0}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma_n^0}(T)\\)</span> 为既有局部反射模式，结论中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 由显示的全称量词绑定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n}}(T)\n\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n+1}}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n}}(T)\n\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n+1}}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>包含方向来自\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{0}_{n}(T)\\subseteq\\Sigma^{0}_{n+1}(T)\">\\(\\Sigma^{0}_{n}(T)\\subseteq\\Sigma^{0}_{n+1}(T)\\)</span>；理论参数不能从句法类\n的签名中省略。</li>\n<li>这里断言的是反射模式集合的嵌套，不额外声称无条件严格性或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{0}\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{0}\\)</span> 与一致性的等价</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-reflection-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0d2469f2990d6f49","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-reflection-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-reflection-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0d2469f2990d6f49","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_T$ 为递归可枚举算术理论；$\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_T:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_T)$ 和 $\\Sigma_n^0(T)=\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_T(n)$ 取 [[89-df-reflection-formula]] 的同一族，所有反射实例使用同一 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ 和同一编码。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_T:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^0(T)=\\boldsymbol\\Sigma_T(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall k\\in\\omega\\ (\\Sigma_k^0(T)\\subseteq\\Sigma_{k+1}^0(T))","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma_n^0}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n}}(T)\n\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\Sigma^{0}_{n+1}}(T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma^{0}_{n}(T)\\subseteq\\Sigma^{0}_{n+1}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}_{0}","display":false}],"bytes":1394,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-reflection-principle]]／[[89-df-reflection-formula]] → [[89-prop-reflection-hierarchy]]：固定语言与句法类族，并把层级包含前提量化到全部层。"}],"outgoing":["0d2469f2990d6f49"]}